  "body": "### [2.0.6](https://github.com/sammcj/gollama/compare/vv2.0.5...v2.0.6) (2026-09-28)\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* keep VRAM context columns within the requested top ([#240](https://github.com/sammcj/gollama/issues/240)) ([32ca0f0](https://github.com/sammcj/gollama/commit/32ca0f0b21f00e3072934d3aa7466b651573c813))\n\n## What's Changed\n* Added missing https:// prefix to link in README by @groda in https://github.com/sammcj/gollama/pull/237\n* fix: keep VRAM context columns within the requested top by @SashaMIT in https://github.com/sammcj/gollama/pull/240\n\n## New Contributors\n* @groda made their first contribution in https://github.com/sammcj/gollama/pull/237\n* @SashaMIT made their first contribution in https://github.com/sammcj/gollama/pull/240\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/sammcj/gollama/compare/v2.0.5...v2.0.6",
